Hydra Harmonics (N64brew Game Jam 2024, code/hydraharmonics at 0dea720) for the Fire TV remote,
without its commercial font.

  - Text uses Coustard (OFL) instead of Superclarendon, which we can't redistribute
    (overrides/hydraharmonics.mk builds the font; tools/fetch-deps.sh keeps Superclarendon out).
  - The controls panel shows the remote: Up and Down on the direction ring move, OK chomps. Our own
    icons from n64/jam24/assets-remote/hydraharmonics (make-icons.py) replace the joypad's D-pad,
    C, L, R, A and Z icons. The game's input code is unchanged: OK is A, and a gamepad still has
    every button.
  - The minigame description says OK instead of A.

